  "summary": "Record accepted transfer TS half-step convergence and the five reproduced historical regression failures.",
  "payload": {
    "markdown": "- Phase 3.2.0.1: at 400 K the transfer TS central DRC is 0.04069045116 at +/-0.005 eV versus 0.04113190545 at +/-0.01 eV. The absolute difference 0.0004414543 meets the project tolerance 0.0020345226. Both approved native runs converged within 44.17 s total. Both DRC regression suites passed 609 tests. The clean checkpoint full suite retains five failures independently reproduced on the original release baseline and development tree. See reports/multiphase/phase3_2_0_1/test_report.md and historical_regression_debt.md. Batch DRC remains unqualified."
